3
Creating HTML Pages 
•An HTML file must have an .htm  or .html  file 
extension 
•HTML files can be created with text editors: 
–NotePad, NotePad ++, PSPad 
•Or HTML editors (WYSIWYG Editors): 
–Microsoft FrontPage 
–Macromedia Dreamweaver 
–Netscape Composer 
–Visual Studio 


