1) Headings 
<h1> text </h1> -- largest of the six 
<h2> text </h2> 
<h3> text </h3> 
<h4> text </h4> 
<h5> text </h5> 
<h6> text </h6> -- smallest of the six 
align= "position"  --left (default), center or right ▪Headings are important because search engines use 
the headings to index the structure and content of 
your web pages. 

