2) <p> paragraph 
▪<p> defines a paragraph 
▪Add align = "position"  (left, center, right) 
▪Multiple <p>'s do not create blank lines 
▪Use <br> for blank line 
▪Fully-specified text uses <p> and </p>, but </p> is 
optional 

