3) Colors 
▪Values for bgcolor  and color 
•many are predefined (red, blue, green, ...) 
•all colors can be specified as a six character hexadecimal 
value: #RRGGBB 
•#FF0000 – red 
•#888888 – gray 
•#00FF00 –green 
•#000000 – black 

